Below is still the diff for the config changes between 3.0 
to 3.1 .  I suppose these are implicit/automatical ones 
(if entering 'make menuconf' and go out without making 
changes).    As said, with all 3.0 's it booted, since 3.1 
not longer. Perhaps one of these config differences is the 
reason.
wl


